      en: ["The Venetians began construction in the year 1402.", "The artificial moat 'Contrafossa' was dug in 1537.", "Agios Georgios church was built by the British in 1840.", "Successfully resisted three Ottoman sieges (1537, 1571, 1716).", "Currently houses the Music Department of the Ionian University.", "The highest point is the citadel featuring a lighthouse."],
