      en: ["Total length of the bridge is 2,880 meters.", "Inaugurated on August 7, 2004.", "The four pylons reach a height of up to 160 meters.", "Designed by architect Berdj Mikaelian.", "Can withstand earthquakes up to 7.0 on the Richter scale.", "Construction costs totaled approximately 630 million euros."],
